# Allowlist: this project commits only its source/docs.
# Everything else here (video, audio, images, Manim cache, QC frame dumps,
# per-frame render work) is a regenerable build artifact and stays untracked.

# 1. Ignore everything by default.
*

# 2. But still descend into subdirectories, so the rules below can match
#    files nested inside them. Without this, git never looks past step 1.
!*/

# 3. Re-include the files we actually keep.
!beat_sheet.json
!manifest.json
!qc-sheet.png
!*.md
!*.py
!*.txt

# 4. ...except Manim's partial_movie_file_list.txt scratch, which just points
#    at the ignored .mp4 chunks in its render cache. Must come after !*.txt.
media/videos/**/*.txt

# 5. Keep this file itself tracked.
!.gitignore
